    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "Senzu is an enchanting Fantasy Farming-Space Simulation RPG! (Magic in Space! No technology) <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876480/extras/b58d7fa9ebf7819a4edd1977cbbf3806.poster.avif?t=1714717777\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876480/extras/b58d7fa9ebf7819a4edd1977cbbf3806.webm?t=1714717777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876480/extras/b58d7fa9ebf7819a4edd1977cbbf3806.mp4?t=1714717777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>On a personal journey, you carry the <strong>'Hallowed Seeds'</strong> of your lost family's memory, seeking a sacred resting place in the mystical Verdant Region. <br>The Crethun, <strong>a dark guild from the south</strong>, has emerged and <strong>threatens to prevent you from finding a home</strong> in their relentless quest for an ancient power, fallen from a long-lost god.<br>Will you find peace in the home you are searching for, or will your heart lead you to explore the expanse of the Verdant Region?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876480/extras/3d3dce999461aa72a88de5ec3a79b079.poster.avif?t=1714717777\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876480/extras/3d3dce999461aa72a88de5ec3a79b079.webm?t=1714717777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876480/extras/3d3dce999461aa72a88de5ec3a79b079.mp4?t=1714717777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876480/extras/d40098f4ee31d16a0422a9dc8413bae8.webp?t=1714717777\" width=621 height=38 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Senzu Creatures</h2><strong>&quot;The Drifting&quot;</strong> phenomenon has significantly weakened the connection of magic to the Yodin. Only those who can bond with a Senzu possess the ability to Aetherweave. Find, care for, train, love, and build a relationship with each of these wonderful, mystical creatures. As the bond with your Senzu grows, so will your ability to wield this ancient power.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876480/extras/69ae63772e5af703f80304e7fed17c48.poster.avif?t=1714717777\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876480/extras/69ae63772e5af703f80304e7fed17c48.webm?t=1714717777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876480/extras/69ae63772e5af703f80304e7fed17c48.mp4?t=1714717777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Own Home</h2>Find your own garden among the stars and grow your own home! Farm your land and use it to care for your Senzu, because without them, you wont get very far!<br>Take the treasures you find in the Verdant Region and cultivate them here, making this place truly your own!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876480/extras/3980a1ec5afa29fd7466ec1364e69254.poster.avif?t=1714717777\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876480/extras/3980a1ec5afa29fd7466ec1364e69254.webm?t=1714717777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876480/extras/3980a1ec5afa29fd7466ec1364e69254.mp4?t=1714717777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover And Explore</h2><strong>Guild of Aetherweaving</strong><br>Since \u2018The Drifting,\u2019 the role of the Guild has changed significantly from its early days, when it was just a small group of odd men and women waving their limbs about. In the current era, it has become a respected name and a place you\u2019ll want to visit if you need magical assistance with a problem.<br><br><br><strong>The Dark Guild</strong><br>Rumors have been floating around, that the Verdant Region has an infestation down south from a group who are searching for something\u2026<br><br><br><strong>Star Boats</strong><br>Feeling brave? Explore shallow space in a \u201cNavis\u201d (a star boat). Need to travel across the void of deep space? No worries \u2014 you should be able to find someone to charter a \u201cCirunavis\u201d (a starship). There are lots of isles in the Verdant Region for you to explore!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876480/extras/edd9d769d4455c750aa72e6534417b67.poster.avif?t=1714717777\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876480/extras/edd9d769d4455c750aa72e6534417b67.webm?t=1714717777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876480/extras/edd9d769d4455c750aa72e6534417b67.mp4?t=1714717777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong><br>Wild Senzu</strong><br>While exploring in the Verdant Region be on the lookout for wild Senzu! They\u2019re quite timid creatures so good luck! If you do spot one, I wouldn\u2019t suggest trying to catch it\u2026 If you have room for another Senzu you'll have to find a \u201cSenzu Bloom\u201d and hope you get a \u201cSenzu Seed\u201d!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876480/extras/ef50dae47e2588da1376b7d9f2b6fb93.poster.avif?t=1714717777\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876480/extras/ef50dae47e2588da1376b7d9f2b6fb93.webm?t=1714717777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876480/extras/ef50dae47e2588da1376b7d9f2b6fb93.mp4?t=1714717777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Senzu is a game that I think about 24/7 and am incredibly passionate about.<br>I hope you enjoy the world of Senzu!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876480/extras/f7982f81e20f3542100986b285aa449b.avif?t=1714717777\" width=621 height=113 /></span>",
